# Build output
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/

# The repository root .gitignore has a generic `build/` rule for compiler
# output, which also matches this site's `build/` documentation section and
# would silently drop those pages from commits. Re-include the directory (git
# cannot re-include files whose parent directory is excluded, so the directory
# itself must be negated).
!src/content/docs/build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated by scripts/prepare.mjs — do NOT edit, and do NOT commit.
#
# Documentation PAGES are not generated: src/content/docs/ is the source of
# truth. Only machine-readable facts are, so that no constant is ever retyped
# into prose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ← firmware/env constants extracted from RLControl.ino, policy_weights.h and
#   pendulum_env.py, rendered by ConstantsTable.astro and the step-6 page.
src/generated/

# ← extracted from the committed policy_weights.h at every build, so the demo
#   always runs exactly the network that is flashed on the Nano.
public/sim/policy.json

# ← copied from three's examples/jsm/libs/draco/gltf at every build
public/draco/

# ← copied from the repository-root diagrams/ at every build
public/diagrams/

# NOTE: public/models/*.glb, public/sim/model.xml, public/sim/scene.json and
# public/sim/replay.json are deliberately COMMITTED, not generated. They are
# pinned demo assets (58 KB of draco-compressed meshes, one MJCF snapshot, the
# measured visual transforms, one real-rig capture slice) whose inputs are
# either large binaries or gitignored recordings. Regenerate them with
# scripts/export_assets.py when the meshes, URDF or champion rig change.
